{
  "description": "Golden exact structured-filter corpus shared by the TS server and the local Rust backend. Commit timestamp is fixed to commitTimestamp; documents without valid_from use it. Queryless results order by bytewise path then table row index (row-less hits sort first per document); each item is the containing chunk plus the exact stored row. Hybrid cases use the search.json fixture embedder normalize([1 + count(alpha), 1 + count(beta)]) and score = sum over arms (vector first) of 1/(60 + rank).",
